-q-95cbfecfdd97f188000f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"houfei-p0015","role":"占者","evidence":["fangji-q-95cbfecfdd97f188000f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["fangji-q-95cbfecfdd97f188000f"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-95cbfecfdd97f188000f","order":5976},{"id":"fangji-e-8df2646c7a4990abbb4a","title":"问者语宣前后三时皆不梦也、聊试君耳，宣对曰此神灵动君使言，故与真梦无异；又问三梦刍狗而占不同，宣曰刍狗者祭神之物：始梦当得余食，既讫为车所轹故中梦当堕车折脚，车轹之后必载以为樵故后梦忧失火","accounts":[{"id":"fangji-a-8df2646c7a4990abbb4a","label":"正文","text":"问者语宣前后三时皆不梦也、聊试君耳，宣对曰此神灵动君使言，故与真梦无异；又问三梦刍狗而占不同，宣曰刍狗者祭神之物：始梦当得余食，既讫为车所轹故中梦当堕车折脚，车轹之后必载以为樵故后梦忧失火","evidence":["fangji-q-2febd808d67b5586630f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"houfei-p0015","role":"答者","evidence":["fangji-q-2febd808d67b5586630f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["fangji-q-2febd808d67b5586630f"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-2febd808d67b5586630f","order":5977},{"id":"fangji-e-17d7205e575c884aad91","title":"周宣明帝末卒","accounts":[{"id":"fangji-a-17d7205e575c884aad91","label":"正文","text":"周宣明帝末卒","evidence":["fangji-q-5b9772d38eb510a5824f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"houfei-p0015","role":"卒者","evidence":["fangji-q-5b9772d38eb510a5824f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"明帝末","precision":"undated","basis":"保留原纪年及粒度；本账户未独立归一公元年，不继承相邻事件年份。","evidence":["fangji-q-5b9772d38eb510a5824f"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-5b9772d38eb510a5824f","order":5978}],"persons":[{"id":"houfei-p0015","name":"周宣","evidence":["houfei-q-p004","wgc-q0039","fangji-q-c3c8102e37a35a267d74","fangji-q-db5bab053ac9b429bc5b","fangji-q-b80edc7fdc8cc314381d","fangji-q-c2dffc2d33a7ff250c03","fangji-q-f64ccf800889bfda8e88","fangji-q-e8ede82ab67dd97873dd","fangji-q-68230cbf736662afe90c","fangji-q-b22e44d7e929ba4ef1a4","fangji-q-95cbfecfdd97f188000f","fangji-q-2febd808d67b5586630f","fangji-q-5b9772d38eb510a5824f","fangji-q-c47e678e494fa07f2e8e","fangji-q-51ed9b38c847162f7953","fangji-q-76e1deb94d2f7c381e5c"],"facts":[{"id":"fangji-f-1e907682464964993df5","text":"字孔和，乐安人，为郡吏。","evidence":["fangji-q-51ed9b38c847162f7953"]},{"id":"fangji-f-934de6f29dbfe71aad78","text":"本传称叙梦十中八九，是史家评价，非本次测评。","evidence":["fangji-q-76e1deb94d2f7c381e5c"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"houfei-m-p004-houfei-p0015","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-p004"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o050-houfei-p0015","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及周宣","evidence":["wgc-q0039"]},{"id":"fangji-m-9a9fcf7d2cd7ab5ab029","kind":"mention","text":"陈寿评华佗、杜夔、朱建平、周宣、管辂方技","evidence":["fangji-q-c47e678e494fa07f2e8e"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"fangji-q-2febd808d67b5586630f","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-206b4961ad7de22fa5f6","layer":"original","quote":"语宣曰：“前后三时，皆不梦也〖13〗；聊试君耳，何以皆验邪？”宣对白：“此神灵动君使言〖14〗，故与真梦无异也。”又问宣曰：“三梦刍狗，而其占不同。何也？”宣曰：“刍狗者，祭神之物；故君始梦，当得余食也〖15〗。祭祀既讫，则刍狗为车所轹〖16〗；故中梦当堕车折脚也〖17〗。刍狗既车轹之后，必载以为樵；故后梦忧失火也","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":158,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-51ed9b38c847162f7953","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-c143ab9305b88567731c","layer":"original","quote":"周宣字孔和，乐安人也。为郡吏。太守杨沛梦人曰〖1〗：“八月一日，曹公当至；必与君杖，饮以药酒。”使宣占之。是时黄巾贼起，宣对曰：“夫杖起弱者〖2〗，药治人病；八月一日，贼必除灭。”至期，贼果破。","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":222,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-5b9772d38eb510a5824f","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-38bd52a284d59fedbd28","layer":"original","quote":"明帝末卒","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":231,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-68230cbf736662afe90c","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-71d24fca54c7a490cf2a","layer":"original","quote":"尝有问宣曰：“吾昨夜梦见刍狗〖11〗。其占何也？”宣答曰：“君欲得美食耳〖12〗！”有顷，出行，果遇丰膳","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":227,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":66,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-76e1deb94d2f7c381e5c","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-38bd52a284d59fedbd28","layer":"original","quote":"宣之叙梦，凡此类也，十中八九。世以比建平之相矣。其余效故不次列〖18〗。明帝末卒。","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":231,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-95cbfecfdd97f188000f","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-55b7552b60d9d2e70f96","layer":"original","quote":"宣曰：“君家失火。当善护之！”俄遂火起","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":229,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-b22e44d7e929ba4ef1a4","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-ec49b2b175087aef1dc3","layer":"original","quote":"后又问宣曰：“昨夜复梦见刍狗。何也？”宣曰：“君欲堕车折脚。宜戒慎之！”顷之，果如宣言","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-b80edc7fdc8cc314381d","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-2e61368cd5036739a180","layer":"original","quote":"文帝问宣曰：“吾梦殿屋两瓦堕地，化为双鸳鸯。此何谓也？”宣对曰：“后宫当有暴死者。”帝曰：“吾诈卿耳！”宣对曰：“夫梦者意耳〖5〗；苟以形言〖6〗，便占吉凶。”言未毕，而黄门令奏宫人相杀","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":224,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":93,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-c2dffc2d33a7ff250c03","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-4f8a1f5fc51f807ba33a","layer":"original","quote":"无几，帝复问曰：“我昨夜梦青气，自地属天。”宣对曰：“天下当有贵女子冤死。”是时，帝已遣使赐甄后玺书〖8〗；闻宣言而悔之，遣人追使者不及","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":225,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-c3c8102e37a35a267d74","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-c143ab9305b88567731c","layer":"original","quote":"太守杨沛梦人曰〖1〗：“八月一日，曹公当至；必与君杖，饮以药酒。”使宣占之。是时黄巾贼起，宣对曰：“夫杖起弱者〖2〗，药治人病；八月一日，贼必除灭。”至期，贼果破","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":222,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":15,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-c47e678e494fa07f2e8e","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-18cfff7c6f84b0a80c2c","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：华佗之医诊，杜夔之声乐，朱建平之相术，周宣之相梦，管辂之术筮：诚皆玄妙之殊巧，非常之绝技矣。昔史迁著扁鹊、仓公、日者之传〖1〗，所以广异闻而表奇事也；故存录云尔。","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":463,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-db5bab053ac9b429bc5b","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-94ab84ffd478fd581703","layer":"original","quote":"后东平刘桢梦蛇生四足，穴居门中。使宣占之，宣曰：“此为国梦〖3〗，非君家之事也。当杀女子而作贼者。”顷之，女贼郑、姜，遂俱夷讨","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":223,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-e8ede82ab67dd97873dd","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-71d24fca54c7a490cf2a","layer":"original","quote":"以宣为中郎〖10〗，属太史","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":227,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-f64ccf800889bfda8e88","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-3064a3db78dd153bac0e","layer":"original","quote":"帝复问曰：“吾梦磨钱文〖9〗，欲令灭而更愈明。此何谓邪？”宣怅然不对。帝重问之，宣对曰：“此自陛下家事。虽意欲尔，而太后不听，是以文欲灭而明耳。”时帝欲治弟植之罪；逼于太后，但加贬爵","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":226,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":91,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-e-p004c-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-6cb6203d4a60347d4a19","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：文帝梦磨钱，欲使文灭而更愈明，以问周宣。宣答曰：“此陛下家事，虽意欲尔，而太后不听。”则太后用意，不得如此书所言也。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":68,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c4c87d739b54c91c93b0","start":117,"end":180,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-p004","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-6cb6203d4a60347d4a19","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》曰：“后以国用不足，减损御食，诸金银器物皆去之。东阿王植，太后少子，最爱之。后植犯法，为有司所奏；文帝令太后弟子奉车都尉兰，持公卿议白太后。太后曰：‘不意此儿所作如是！汝还语帝：不可以我故坏国法。’及自见帝，不以为言。”臣松之按：文帝梦磨钱，欲使文灭而更愈明，以问周宣。宣答曰：“此陛下家事，虽意欲尔，而太后不听。”则太后用意，不得如此书所言也。","attribution":"《魏书》及裴松之按","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":68,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c4c87d739b54c91c93b0","start":0,"end":180,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0039","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-d693a552b14d342eae71","layer":"original","quote":"后迁城阳太守〖5〗。是时并州（右）〔左〕贤王刘豹并为一部〖6〗。艾上言曰：“戎狄兽心，不以义亲；强则侵暴，弱则内附。故周宣有狁之寇〖7〗，汉祖有平城之围〖8〗；每匈奴一盛，为前代重患。自单于在外〖9〗，莫能牵制长卑〖10〗；诱而致之，使来入侍〖11〗。由是羌夷失统〖12〗，合散无主；以单于在内，万里顺轨〖13〗。今单于之尊日疏，外土之威浸重〖14〗，则胡虏不可不深备也。闻刘豹部有叛胡，可因叛，割为二国，以分其势。去卑功显前朝〖15〗，而子不继业；宜加其子显号〖16〗，使居雁门。离国弱寇〖17〗，追录旧勋，此御边长计也。”","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":263,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
